<title>ITALY: Italy pension bill to rise in line with growth - Prodi.</title>
<headline>Italy pension bill to rise in line with growth - Prodi.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Prime Minister Romano Prodi said on Friday Italiam pensions spending would rise next year in line with economic growth.</p>
<p>Prodi made the remarks at a news conference after the cabinet approved the government's three-year economic strategy.</p>
<p>Rome newsroom +396-6782505</p>
</text>
